/**
 * AI studio photos in the Telegram bot.
 *
 * Photo kinds: AI fashion model (default for adult clothing), white background (shoes, bags,
 * accessories, kids), optional mannequin. Each kind is generated by its OWN background job
 * (separate serverless invocation with its own time budget). Each photo is sent as soon as
 * it is ready, followed by a refreshed choice message. A failed photo is reported with a
 * "Try again" button.
 *
 * Flow for a new product (automatic): photo upload → draft → jobs → seller picks photos.
 * Publishing before the jobs finish is fine: late photos are offered for the live product.
 * Flow for an existing product: "✨ Enhance photo" on the product card.
 *
 * Callback data:
 *   aiph_d_<sessionId>_<w|m|h|b|o>   – choose photos for a draft
 *   aiph_p_<productId>_<w|m|h|b|o>   – choose photos for a published product
 *   aiph_r_<d|p>_<id>_<w|m|h>        – retry a failed photo (draft / product)
 *   (w = white, m = mannequin, h = AI model, b = all generated, o = original)
 *
 * State:
 *   draft.ai_photos            = StudioState (+ draft.photo_choice, draft.photo_choice_by_seller)
 *   product.ai_metadata.ai_photo_candidates = { white, mannequin, model }
 *   product.ai_metadata.ai_photo_job        = StudioState without urls (+ id)
 */
